# Allowlist: every build that uses the repo root as context (.devcontainer/Dockerfile
# in CI and `just dev-image`, .devcontainer/acceptance.Dockerfile) COPYs only the
# files re-included below. Everything else stays out of the build context so it
# neither ships to the daemon nor enters ctxloom's agent-image identity
# (isolation.baseStage.identity), which would otherwise change on every commit.
# Docker and podman both read this file (podman when no .containerignore exists).
# A new COPY from the context must be re-included here.
*
!.devcontainer/lizard-requirements.txt
